[Quotes]
; Up to 100 victory quotes can be specified per language (victory0 - victory99)
victory0 = "Who enters my demesne? Humans, is it?"
victory1 = "What do you seek from this place? Power? Fame? Foolish humans."
victory2 = "I see you've begun to understand my glorious existence here."
victory3 = "Yet, perhaps it is best you see for yourselves my power... Power that held the whole world in fear... The power of the Void!"
victory4 = "The forbidden power has finally been released..."